            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DBC10, Drive-In Door Ball Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBall catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. Adjustable drive-in ball catch, not mounting plate to mortise. \r\n<br>Does NOT include <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-strike-plate-deltana-spb349\"><b>Ball Catch Strike Plate</b>.</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DBC10-size.jpg?v=1704354734\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DBC10 Drive-In Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-with-round-corners-deltana-bc218r\"><b>Ball Catch with Round Corners</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-deltana-bc218\"><b>Ball Catch with Square Corners</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-strike-plate-deltana-spb349\"><b>Ball Catch Strike Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DBC10 Drive-In  Ball Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Length: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DBC10.pdf?v=1691095314\"><b>Deltana DBC10 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> <b>Does NOT include a strike plate.</b>\r\n</p>",
